---
---
<div class="relative sm:border-2 sm:border-mariner-400 px-6 sm:px-8 py-2 sm:py-4 rounded-2xl sm:backdrop-blur-md sm:shadow-neon-blue flex flex-col gap-5 items-center justify-center text-center md:text-left w-full animate-fade-in sm:neon-presentation h-full">

  {/* Nombre */}
  <h1 class="name-title text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-mariner-200 mb-1 tracking-tight w-full leading-tight">
    Construyo software que los equipos pueden mantener, escalar y entender.
  </h1>

  {/* Rol */}
  <h2 class="name-title text-lg md:text-xl font-light text-mariner-400 tracking-wide w-full">
    Ingeniero de Software · DDD & Arquitecturas Limpias
  </h2>

  {/* Subheadline */}
  <p class="text-base text-white/80 w-fit max-w-xs sm:max-w-fit text-center md:text-left tracking-wide leading-relaxed">
    Especializado en reducir complejidad técnica sin sacrificar velocidad de producto. Ayudo a equipos a diseñar software que dura.
  </p>

  {/* Badge DDDominio */}
  <div class="w-full flex justify-center md:justify-start">
    <a
      href="https://dddominio.com"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      aria-label="Ir al blog DDDominio sobre DDD y arquitectura (abre en nueva pestaña)"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-mariner-500 text-mariner-300 bg-mariner-900/40 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-sm hover:border-mariner-300 hover:text-mariner-100 transition-colors duration-200"
    >
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 18h12v-2H3v2zm0-5h12v-2H3v2zm0-7v2h12V6H3zm14 11.59L20.59 15 22 16.41l-3 3-1.41-1.41L19 16.59zm1.41-5L22 13.41l-1.41 1.41-3-3L17 10.41 18.41 9 22 12.59z"/></svg>
      Autor de DDDominio — arquitectura y DDD en profundidad
      <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3v2h3.59l-9.83 9.83 1.41 1.41L19 6.41V10h2V3z"/><path d="M5 5v14h14v-7h-2v5H7V7h5V5H5z"/></svg>
    </a>
  </div>

  {/* Tags de especialización */}
  <ul class="w-full flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 justify-center md:justify-start" role="list" aria-label="Especialidades técnicas">
    {[
      "Arquitecturas",
      "DDD",
      "Microservicios",
      "React",
      "Node.js",
      "TDD",
      "Event-driven Architecture",
    ].map((tech) => (
      <li>
        <span
          class="bg-mariner-800/70 text-mariner-200 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md text-sm font-medium border border-mariner-600"
        >
          {tech}
        </span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
</div>
